{"success":true,"extraData":{"total":211,"totalPages":71,"perPage":3,"currentPage":1},"data":{"offers":[{"id":5683439,"title":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2","area":50,"description":"V zastoupen\u00ed majitele nab\u00edz\u00edme k pron\u00e1jmu p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00fd, zrekonstruovan\u00fd byt o dispozici 2+1 s balkonem a v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e cca 50 m\u00b2, kter\u00fd se nach\u00e1z\u00ed ve 3. nadzemn\u00edm podla\u017e\u00ed n\u00e1jemn\u00edho domu s v\u00fdtahem na ulici Peka\u0159sk\u00e1 28 v Brn\u011b.\nByt je situov\u00e1n v atraktivn\u00ed lokalit\u011b \u0161ir\u0161\u00edho centra m\u011bsta s v\u00fdbornou ob\u010danskou vybavenost\u00ed a snadnou dostupnost\u00ed do centra. V bl\u00edzkosti domu se nav\u00edc nach\u00e1z\u00ed rozlehl\u00fd m\u011bstsk\u00fd park hradu \u0160pilberk, kter\u00fd nab\u00edz\u00ed p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed pro proch\u00e1zky, sport i odpo\u010dinek.\nByt ned\u00e1vno pro\u0161el rekonstrukc\u00ed a nab\u00edz\u00ed praktick\u00e9 dispozi\u010dn\u00ed \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed se dv\u011bma samostatn\u00fdmi, nepr\u016fchoz\u00edmi pokoji. Z prostorn\u00e9 p\u0159eds\u00edn\u011b je p\u0159\u00edstup do obou pokoj\u016f, kuchyn\u011b a koupelny s toaletou. Z jednoho z pokoj\u016f je vstup na balkon.\nByt se pronaj\u00edm\u00e1 jako nevybaven\u00fd. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed kuchyn\u011b je kuchy\u0148sk\u00e1 linka s elektrick\u00fdm spor\u00e1kem se sklokeramickou varnou deskou a praktick\u00e1 sp\u00ed\u017e. Koupelna je vybavena sprchov\u00fdm koutem, umyvadlem, toaletou a p\u0159\u00edpojkou na pra\u010dku.\nVyt\u00e1p\u011bn\u00ed je zaji\u0161t\u011bno centr\u00e1ln\u011b z vlastn\u00ed kotelny v dom\u011b, oh\u0159ev tepl\u00e9 vody elektrick\u00fdm bojlerem.\nM\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed n\u00e1jemn\u00e9 \u010din\u00ed 18.900 K\u010d.\nZ\u00e1loha na slu\u017eby je 2.300 K\u010d \/ 1 osoba \/ m\u011bs\u00edc, ka\u017ed\u00e1 dal\u0161\u00ed osoba + 600 K\u010d \/ m\u011bs\u00edc.\nV z\u00e1loh\u00e1ch jsou zahrnuty n\u00e1klady na vyt\u00e1p\u011bn\u00ed, studenou vodu, elekt\u0159inu spole\u010dn\u00fdch prostor, \u00faklid, deratizaci, provoz v\u00fdtahu a spr\u00e1vu domu.\nSpot\u0159ebu elektrick\u00e9 energie v byt\u011b si n\u00e1jemce hrad\u00ed samostatn\u011b na z\u00e1klad\u011b vlastn\u00ed smlouvy s dodavatelem.\nByt je k dispozici od 1. 12. 2026.\nN\u00e1jemn\u00ed d\u016fm, trval\u00e9 bydli\u0161t\u011b, rezidentn\u00ed parkov\u00e1n\u00ed\ninfo a prohl\u00eddka na. anon@example.com  nebo 000 000 000\n\n - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nM\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed poplatky: 0 K\u010d\nProvize: Ano\n","disposition":"twoPlusOne","houseType":null,"geoCoordinates":{"lat":49.19216,"lng":16.60144},"photos":[{"id":24098647,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/7b\/BmvVGlJwzZ24098647","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098648,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/8f\/fH5tstIfIK24098648","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098649,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/9l\/LZGxM5Yxjq24098649","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098650,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/0h\/hGAoroPAGO24098650","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098651,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/1m\/mbTNecYSwt24098651","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098652,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/2u\/uPMZYA6Uqk24098652","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098653,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/3w\/W2pY4KEMq124098653","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"},{"id":24098654,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/4i\/Iuf2WrkLFp24098654","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 2+1 50 m2"}],"rentalPrice":{"value":18900,"currency":"CZK"},"isNoCommission":false,"depositPrice":null,"monthlyFeesPrice":null,"priceUnit":"perMonth","published":"2026-10-19T12:29:22","seo":"pronajem-brno-brno-mesto-pekarska-2-1","street":{"id":105036,"title":"Peka\u0159sk\u00e1"},"village":{"id":347,"title":"Brno"},"villagePart":{"id":869,"title":"Brno-m