13 1 m\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed  n\u00e1jem v\u010d. z\u00e1lohy na slu\u017eby (20.050 K\u010d\/20.900 K\u010d)\nVelkou v\u00fdhodou bytu je atraktivn\u00ed lokalita s ve\u0161kerou ob\u010danskou vybavenost\u00ed v okol\u00ed a velmi dobrou dostupnost\u00ed do centra m\u011bsta. V bl\u00edzkosti domu se nach\u00e1z\u00ed tak\u00e9 m\u011bstsk\u00fd park Lu\u017e\u00e1nky, kter\u00fd nab\u00edz\u00ed p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed pro sport, proch\u00e1zky i klidn\u00e9 chv\u00edle odpo\u010dinku.\n\n - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nPozn\u00e1mka k cen\u011b: + z\u00e1lohy na  slu\u017eby 2.550 K\u010d\/m\u011bs.\/1 osoba, ka\u017ed\u00e1 dal\u0161\u00ed osoba +850 K\u010d\/m\u011bs.,z\u00e1lohu na elekt\u0159inu hradn\u00ed n\u00e1jemce p\u0159\u00edmo dodavateli, vratn\u00e1 kauce 1 m\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed n\u00e1jem (platba v\u010d. slu\u017eeb), + provize RK\nM\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed poplatky: 0 K\u010d\nProvize: Ano\n","disposition":"onePlusOne","houseType":null,"geoCoordinates":{"lat":49.20893,"lng":16.60166},"photos":[{"id":24319011,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/1d\/d7wxYZ0kOK24319011","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+1 54 m2"},{"id":24319013,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/3j\/Jx6qBRbXGy24319013","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+1 54 m2"},{"id":24319015,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/5z\/z7m3MCWm5p24319015","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+1 54 m2"},{"id":24319016,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/6c\/CFvbYPn1IR24319016","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+1 54 m2"},{"id":24319018,"path":"https:\/\/photo.ulovdomov.cz\/8d\/dYDk4xQ2SF24319018","alt":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+1 54 m2"}],"rentalPrice":{"value":17500,"currency":"CZK"},"isNoCommission":false,"depositPrice":null,"monthlyFeesPrice":null,"priceUnit":"perMonth","published":"2026-11-24T12:09:53","seo":"pronajem-brno-veveri-drevarska-1-1","street":{"id":6519,"title":"D\u0159eva\u0159sk\u00e1"},"village":{"id":347,"title":"Brno"},"villagePart":{"id":826,"title":"Veve\u0159\u00